  "description": "MongoDB NoSQL storage provider for Zetian SMTP Server. Provides flexible, schema-less message persistence with advanced features including GridFS for large attachment storage, automatic TTL-based message expiration, horizontal sharding for scalability, text indexing for full-text search, and built-in compression. Perfect for modern applications requiring flexible data models, automatic scaling, and document-oriented storage without rigid schemas.",
